msgid "ReliefOS 5.3.0"
msgstr "ReliefOS 5.3.0"

msgid "更新内容"
msgstr "Changes"

msgid ""
"新增 C++/FLTK **OpenRC "
"Controller**，支持服务查询与批量操作、依赖和运行级别管理、配置编辑、备份恢复及日志导出。长操作异步执行，图形界面保持普通用户身份，由认证后的受限工作进程执行管理请求。"
msgstr ""
"Added C++/FLTK **OpenRC Controller** with service queries/batch actions, dependency/runlevel "
"management, configuration editing, backup/restore, and log export. Long operations are "
"asynchronous. The GUI remains unprivileged; authenticated restricted workers execute "
"administration requests."

msgid ""
"新增 C++/FLTK **Network Controller**，提供接口查询、DHCP/静态 IPv4/禁用配置、DNS 策略、连接诊断及配置恢复；沿用 OpenRC "
"网络服务和统一解析器发布流程。"
msgstr ""
"Added C++/FLTK **Network Controller** with interface queries, DHCP/static IPv4/disabled "
"configuration, DNS policy, connection diagnostics, and configuration recovery, using existing "
"OpenRC networking and unified resolver publication."

msgid ""
"集成 ReliefNT 原生 **.ko** 的配置、安装、依赖与别名数据库、模块自动加载和薄 "
"initramfs。默认配置仍将生产组件内置，可选择支持独立生命周期的部件为模块；镜像检查根设备与文件系统依赖闭包，不静默改写内核配置。"
msgstr ""
"Integrated configuration, installation, dependency/alias databases, autoloading, and thin "
"initramfs for native ReliefNT **.ko** modules. Production components remain built in by default; "
"components with independent lifecycles may be selected as modules. Images check root-"
"device/filesystem dependency closure without silently rewriting kernel configuration."

msgid "内核更新按版本发布成对的内核、initramfs、模块及 ABI 清单，增加 A/B 引导选择、摘要核对和回退。签名 APK、安装器及恢复流程使用同一配套关系。"
msgstr ""
"Kernel updates publish matching versioned kernel, initramfs, modules, and ABI manifests, adding "
"A/B boot selection, digest verification, and fallback. Signed APKs, installer, and recovery use "
"the same pairing."

msgid ""
"新安装可选择创建并配置 **/swapfile**，提供容量预检、完整分配、0600 权限、fstab/OpenRC 集成和启动后激活检查。默认不创建；更新已有系统保留原有 swap 设置。"
msgstr ""
"New installs can optionally create/configure **/swapfile**, with capacity prechecks, full "
"allocation, 0600 permissions, fstab/OpenRC integration, and postboot activation checks. It is not "
"created by default; existing-system updates preserve swap settings."

msgid ""
"增加 **IPv6 RDNSS** 守护进程与 OpenRC 服务，按路由器通告有效期维护 DNS，通过统一发布器与 DHCP DNS 合并；显式 DNS "
"策略优先。配套用户态接口、头导出和双栈测试同步更新。"
msgstr ""
"Added an **IPv6 RDNSS** daemon/OpenRC service, maintaining DNS for router-advertisement lifetimes "
"and merging with DHCP DNS through a unified publisher; explicit DNS policy takes precedence. "
"Corresponding userspace interfaces, header exports, and dual-stack tests are updated together."

msgid "接入 USB 2.0/3.x 存储及键鼠的系统配置、模块化启动和验证工具，并提供设备移除、只读介质与实际运行边界说明；驱动实现归属 ReliefNT。"
msgstr ""
"Integrated system configuration, modular boot, and validation tools for USB 2.0/3.x storage and "
"keyboards/mice, documenting removal, read-only media, and runtime boundaries. Driver "
"implementations belong to ReliefNT."

msgid "完整打包 GNU coreutils 9.12 的 **109 个命令入口**，核对文件及 APK 所有权并保留旧命令路径；BusyBox 继续提供启动、救援和其余命令。"
msgstr ""
"Fully packaged **109 command entry points** from GNU coreutils 9.12, verifying files/APK ownership"
" and retaining old command paths. BusyBox still supplies boot, rescue, and remaining commands."

msgid "为 Dillo 配置不依赖界面语言的中文字体回退和用户配置初始化；恢复终端上游默认颜色，调整桌面及安装器入口，移除已退休桌面的快捷方式。"
msgstr ""
"Configured UI-language-independent Chinese font fallback and user initialization for Dillo. "
"Restored upstream default terminal colors, adjusted desktop/installer entries, and removed "
"retired-desktop shortcuts."

msgid ""
"移除旧 ReliefOS Desktop/windowd、自研图形 UI 与相关配置和库导出，统一现行 X11/FLTK 路径。整理 Kconfig，主仓只配置产品和应用，内核配置由 "
"ReliefNT 独立维护。"
msgstr ""
"Removed old ReliefOS Desktop/windowd, custom graphics UI, associated configuration, and library "
"exports, standardizing on current X11/FLTK. Reorganized Kconfig: this repository configures "
"products/applications only; ReliefNT maintains kernel configuration independently."

msgid ""
"文档迁移至 **Documentation/** 的 Sphinx/reStructuredText 手册，更新 RPR 文档集成并归档历史 "
"Release；测试按实现归属分仓，增加模块启动、USB、内存压力与桌面延迟的系统验证工具，修复 APK/音频测试的宿主环境适配。"
msgstr ""
"Moved documentation to Sphinx/reStructuredText manuals in **Documentation/**, updated RPR "
"documentation integration, and archived historical Releases. Split tests by implementation "
"ownership; added system tools for module boot, USB, memory pressure, and desktop latency, fixing "
"host-environment integration for APK/audio tests."

msgid "破坏性更新"
msgstr "Breaking changes"

msgid "**是，涉及已退休图形接口、命令提供者、配置与开发路径。**"
msgstr ""
"**Yes: retired graphics interfaces, command providers, configuration, and development paths.**"

msgid "旧 Desktop/windowd、鼠标区域和自研 UI 导出不再提供；依赖这些接口的程序须迁移到现行 X11/FLTK 及公开头文件并重新构建。"
msgstr ""
"Old Desktop/windowd, mouse-region, and custom UI exports are no longer provided. Dependent "
"programs must migrate to current X11/FLTK and public headers and rebuild."

msgid ""
"同名常用命令由 GNU coreutils 提供，选项和输出可能与 BusyBox 不同。APK 正常事务转移文件所有权；自定义脚本需核对实现，救援调用可显式使用 /bin/busybox。"
msgstr ""
"GNU coreutils provides common same-named commands; options/output can differ from BusyBox. Normal "
"APK transactions transfer file ownership. Check implementations in custom scripts; rescue calls "
"may explicitly use /bin/busybox."

msgid "内核、initramfs 与模块必须作为匹配的版本集合更新；旧 .ko 和 Linux 原版二进制 .ko 不能直接混用。更新选择器时需同时安装配套 BIOS/EFI GRUB 模块。"
msgstr ""
"Kernel, initramfs, and modules must update as matching version sets; old .ko and original Linux "
"binary .ko files cannot be mixed directly. Selector updates also require matching BIOS/EFI GRUB "
"modules."

msgid "旧文档和已删除的配置路径不再作为开发入口；使用 Documentation/、当前组件清单和 Kbuild/Kconfig 目标。"
msgstr ""
"Old documentation and deleted configuration paths are no longer development entry points. Use "
"Documentation/, current component manifests, and Kbuild/Kconfig targets."

msgid "更新与迁移注意事项"
msgstr "Update and migration notes"

msgid ""
"本次为 **正式源码 Release**，提供标签及 GitHub 自动源码归档，不附预编译 VMDK、ISO、Installer、SDK 或 APK。使用 Git "
"递归初始化标签固定的子模块；GitHub ZIP/TAR.GZ 不展开子模块。"
msgstr ""
"This is a **stable source release** with tags and GitHub automatic source archives, without "
"prebuilt VMDK, ISO, Installer, SDK, or APK. Recursively initialize tag-pinned submodules with Git;"
" GitHub ZIP/TAR.GZ does not expand them."

msgid ""
"更新前备份用户资料、受保护配置和引导分区。使用新的 O 目录重建；沿用配置时执行 olddefconfig，显式检查内核的 y/m/n 选择。ReliefOS defconfig 同时重置对应的 "
"ReliefNT 配置，普通构建保留已有内核设置。"
msgstr ""
"Back up user data, protected configuration, and boot partitions. Rebuild in a new O directory; run"
" olddefconfig for reused configuration and explicitly check kernel y/m/n choices. ReliefOS "
"defconfig also resets corresponding ReliefNT configuration; normal builds retain kernel settings."

msgid "模块安装于 /lib/modules/<uname -r>/。保留对应恢复版本的内核、initramfs 和模块；不要只复制单个内核文件或将卸载忙碌设备失败视为异常。"
msgstr ""
"Modules install in /lib/modules/<uname -r>/. Retain matching recovery kernels, initramfs, and "
"modules; do not copy only a kernel file or treat refusal to unload busy devices as an error."

msgid ""
"自动 swap 只在全新安装时可选，当前要求支持的 AHCI SATA 后端及启用 swap 的配套内核；NVMe、USB 等后端尚不支持。已有系统不会被自动增添 swap，启用后应检查 "
"/proc/swaps。"
msgstr ""
"Automatic swap is optional only for fresh installs and currently requires supported AHCI SATA "
"backends and matching swap-enabled kernels; NVMe, USB, and other backends are unsupported. "
"Existing systems get no automatic swap additions; check /proc/swaps after enabling."

msgid ""
"网络控制器的持久化编辑仍限于已支持的 IPv4 配置；IPv6 由 SLAAC 和标准命令管理，RDNSS 提供自动 DNS，没有有状态 DHCPv6 地址租约或 DNSSL "
"自动配置。保存并应用网络配置可能中断连接。"
msgstr ""
"Network Controller's persistent editing remains limited to supported IPv4 configuration. IPv6 uses"
" SLAAC/standard commands, and RDNSS supplies automatic DNS, without stateful DHCPv6 address leases"
" or automatic DNSSL. Saving/applying network settings may interrupt connections."

msgid ""
"本次发布核对版本生成、数字宏和严格文档构建，不重新构建或提供系统镜像。历史单项 QEMU 结果不等于本标签整版复验；**VMware "
"验证未完成**，物理硬件未验证。桌面编译压力延迟、ReliefMath 关窗故障和完整本机自举仍有未完成项。"
msgstr ""
"This release checks version generation, numeric macros, and strict documentation builds, without "
"rebuilding/providing system images. Historical individual QEMU results are not full retests of "
"this tag. **VMware validation is incomplete**; physical hardware is unverified. Desktop latency "
"under compilation, ReliefMath close failures, and complete native bootstrap still have unfinished "
"items."

msgid "开发者提示"
msgstr "Developer notes"

msgid ""
"基础版本为 **5.3.0**，主仓生成数字字段为 **5/3/0**，/etc/os-release 的 VERSION_ID 同步为 5.3.0；内核版本与模块 ABI 身份由 "
"ReliefNT 自身生成。"
msgstr ""
"Base version is **5.3.0**, with generated repository numeric fields **5/3/0** and /etc/os-release "
"VERSION_ID 5.3.0. ReliefNT generates its own kernel version/module ABI identity."

msgid "使用根 Make 入口及各目录 Kbuild；第三方保留原生构建系统。内核机制、UAPI 与内核测试在 ReliefNT，系统应用、打包和完整虚拟机编排在 ReliefOS。"
msgstr ""
"Use root Make entry points and per-directory Kbuild; third-party projects retain native build "
"systems. Kernel mechanisms, UAPI, and tests belong to ReliefNT; system applications, packaging, "
"and full-VM orchestration belong to ReliefOS."

msgid "驱动服务表使用版本 2，旧版本描述符会在初始化前拒绝。历史 ABI golden 保留，不能从前缀兼容或定向测试通过推导旧驱动二进制兼容或完整 Linux/POSIX 认证。"
msgstr ""
"The driver service table uses version 2; old descriptors are rejected before initialization. "
"Historical ABI golden data remains. Prefix compatibility or targeted passes do not establish old-"
"driver binary compatibility or full Linux/POSIX certification."

msgid ""
"本说明覆盖主仓 5.1.2 版本提交 **5d844df1a0520c473139737b82a7d810723d4fef** 之后至本标签的有效更新，排除内核实现及纯 gitlink "
"更新；下一版以本次版本提交为起点。"
msgstr ""
"These notes cover effective repository updates after the 5.1.2 version commit "
"**5d844df1a0520c473139737b82a7d810723d4fef** through this tag, excluding kernel implementations "
"and gitlink-only changes. The next range starts at this version commit."
